    "lessons": [
      "Show PAPER. No live wallets. No invented P&L.",
      "Next job reads this sheet before tools.",
      "Grok Build on the harness is dest first \u2192 FIRST \u2192 VERIFY. Log it.",
      "Grok Build directs Gemma / Qwen / Bot / OpenClaw. Pack is a gate, not a mind.",
      "AI-to-AI pass goes through handoff-review. Refuse \u2192 no send.",
      "REVIEW loads living LESSONS + PRINCIPLES. Apply, verify, test, then ship."
    ],
    "principles": [
      "Hash moved or it is a miss. Existing file \u2260 done.",
      "Pack = dest + NOW names + lessons \u226420 + job. Encyclopedia = refuse.",
      "Do not invent dests. Park Law: A Baja \u00b7 B Twin \u00b7 C Paper. First is always-on.",
      "Fail closed. Pack refuse, 402, or review refuse = no send.",
      "Twin is ask.py. Household never Grok Bot. Baja is Grok Build only.",
      "iMessage is the only human socket \u2014 in and out, through OpenClaw. One node.",
      "Ladder: script > Gemma 12b > Qwen 27b > Grok Build > Grok Bot.",
      "Grok Build and Grok Bot are one conductor pair. After ship: one MASTER line."
    ],
    "lessons_n": 6,
